Package: shinyhubidentity
Title: Read the Signed ShinyHub Identity in a Shiny App
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ruben J.", "Jongejan", email = "ruben.jongejan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Verifies the signed identity token that ShinyHub forwards to a
    proxied Shiny app and returns the current user's identity, so apps need no
    JWT plumbing of their own. NULL means the request carried no token (an
    anonymous visitor); a token that is present but fails verification raises a
    shinyhub_identity_error condition, so a misconfigured deployment cannot
    masquerade as a logged-out user.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jose,
    sodium
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/rvben/shinyhub
